  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FRI - LGBTI Children and Youth Vietnam Participation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In a strategic partnership with Save the Children Vietnam, FRI will work with government institutions, civil society organisations, schools and universities to expand their project for lesbian, gay, bisexual and transgender (LGBT) children and youth in Vietnam. The aim of the project is that LGBT children and youth are fully included into society, with equal access to education, employment, health, housing and political participation.</narrative>
  </description>
